        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Powerful Stench"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, olfactory)\n\n30 feet. A creature that enters the area must attempt a 23 Fortitude save. On a failure, the creature is sickened 2, and on a critical failure, the creature is also slowed 1 for as long as it is sickened. While within the aura, the creature takes a \u20132 circumstance penalty to saves to recover from the sickened condition.\n\nA creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune to all xulgaths' stenches for 1 minute."
            },
